@model string
@* Preview + Print. The screen IS the preview, so the printer-unplugged fallback (edge 2) is
   the browser's print-to-PDF of this same layout. The server-rendered PDF affordance that
   05 §6 also calls for is still to come — it needs the QuestPDF document set (ADR-0009). *@
<div class="modal-tools no-print">
    <a class="btn" href="@Model">
        <span class="icon icon-sm" aria-hidden="true">arrow_back</span> Back
    </a>
    <span class="spacer"></span>
    <button type="button" class="btn btn-primary" onclick="window.print()">
        <span class="icon icon-sm" aria-hidden="true">print</span> Print
    </button>
</div>
